2.1.evidence:
1. The Regional Government establishes an Integrated Service Center (PPT) as the Implementing, Prevention and Protection Institution for Women and Children Victims of Violence in the region.
2. PPT as referred to in paragraph (1) consists of elements of:
a. health;
b. psychologists;
c. law enforcement;
d. social and empowerment;
e. education and religion;
f. non-governmental organizations; and
g. private sector.
